WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.438 --> 00:00:03.694
Unit ten. Voice Assistants!

2
00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:09.788
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.838 --> 00:00:13.496
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:17.351
Today we learn about Voice Assistants. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.085 --> 00:00:22.885
Voice assistant. Say it with me. Voice assistant!

6
00:00:26.406 --> 00:00:31.537
Ask a question. Say it with me. Ask a question!

7
00:00:34.966 --> 00:00:39.017
Command. Say it with me. Command!

8
00:00:42.571 --> 00:00:46.564
Listen. Say it with me. Listen!

9
00:00:50.052 --> 00:00:54.219
Respond. Say it with me. Respond!

10
00:00:57.676 --> 00:01:02.243
Smart speaker. Say it with me. Smart speaker!

11
00:01:05.779 --> 00:01:10.179
Microphone. Say it with me. Microphone!

12
00:01:13.733 --> 00:01:17.707
Helpful. Say it with me. Helpful!

13
00:01:21.183 --> 00:01:31.201
A voice assistant listens to my command and responds. I can ask a question using my voice, and a smart speaker's microphone hears me.

14
00:01:31.251 --> 00:01:34.617
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:35.355 --> 00:01:40.904
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:40.954 --> 00:01:42.104
Command!

17
00:01:43.178 --> 00:01:48.531
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.581 --> 00:01:49.831
Microphone!

19
00:01:50.954 --> 00:01:59.702
Did you know? Voice assistants use a technology that turns your spoken words into text the computer can understand!

20
00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:02.309
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:03.286 --> 00:02:12.355
Think and answer. What is one question you might ask a voice assistant?

22
00:02:12.405 --> 00:02:13.555
Great answer!

23
00:02:14.578 --> 00:02:20.736
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:20.786 --> 00:02:23.930
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

